{"seq":4,"slug":"case-studies","title":"案例分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/devops-tools/monorepo-engineering/migration-and-scale/case-studies","wordCount":929,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"案例分析\">案例分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>本案例集用三种典型架构对照说明&quot;Monorepo 不是一种固定模式，而是随业务特征变化的架构选择&quot;：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>场景特征</th>\n<th>核心价值</th>\n<th>是否发布 npm</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>前端 Monorepo</td>\n<td>多前端应用共享 UI 与工具</td>\n<td>UI 复用 + 统一规范</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全栈 Monorepo</td>\n<td>前端 + 后端 + 共享类型</td>\n<td>前后端类型安全</td>\n<td>部分可选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>开源库 Monorepo</td>\n<td>多包独立版本、独立发布周期</td>\n<td>多包协调发布</td>\n<td>是</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>三者的共性技术基座相同——pnpm workspace + Turborepo + TypeScript 类型安全——<strong>差异集中在版本管理与构建需求</strong>：纯内部使用的前端 Monorepo 不需要版本管理和发布，源码直引即可；开源库 Monorepo 则必须处理多包独立版本、Changesets 发布与 npm Provenance。这印证了本节的结论：架构选择应基于业务特征而非技术偏好。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三种典型-monorepo-架构\">三种典型 Monorepo 架构</h2><p>Monorepo 并非一种固定的架构模式，不同的业务场景和团队特征会催生出截然不同的仓库结构。本节通过三个典型案例——<strong>前端 Monorepo</strong>、<strong>全栈 Monorepo</strong> 和<strong>开源库 Monorepo</strong>——展示不同场景下的架构选择和实践差异。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 前端 Monorepo&#10;        FE_WEB[web 主站]&#10;        FE_ADMIN[admin 后台]&#10;        FE_H5[H5 移动端]&#10;        FE_UI[共享 UI 库]&#10;        FE_UTILS[工具函数]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 全栈 Monorepo&#10;        FS_WEB[前端应用]&#10;        FS_API[后端服务]&#10;        FS_TYPES[共享类型]&#10;        FS_DB[数据库 Schema]&#10;        FS_UTILS[共享工具]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 开源库 Monorepo&#10;        OS_CORE[core]&#10;        OS_REACT[react adapter]&#10;        OS_VUE[vue adapter]&#10;        OS_CLI[cli]&#10;        OS_TYPES[types]&#10;    end\">graph TB\n    subgraph 前端 Monorepo\n        FE_WEB[web 主站]\n        FE_ADMIN[admin 后台]\n        FE_H5[H5 移动端]\n        FE_UI[共享 UI 库]\n        FE_UTILS[工具函数]\n    end\n    subgraph 全栈 Monorepo\n        FS_WEB[前端应用]\n        FS_API[后端服务]\n        FS_TYPES[共享类型]\n        FS_DB[数据库 Schema]\n        FS_UTILS[共享工具]\n    end\n    subgraph 开源库 Monorepo\n        OS_CORE[core]\n        OS_REACT[react adapter]\n        OS_VUE[vue adapter]\n        OS_CLI[cli]\n        OS_TYPES[types]\n    end</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"案例一-前端-monorepo\">案例一：前端 Monorepo</h2><h3 id=\"场景特征\">场景特征</h3><p>一个中型团队维护多个前端应用（主站、管理后台、H5 页面），共享 UI 组件库和工具函数。所有应用使用 React + TypeScript 技术栈。</p>\n<h3 id=\"架构设计\">架构设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"frontend-monorepo/&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   ├── web/                   # Next.js 主站&#10;│   ├── admin/                 # Vite + React 管理后台&#10;│   └── h5/                    # Vite + React 移动端&#10;├── packages/&#10;│   ├── ui/                    # 共享 UI 组件库&#10;│   ├── hooks/                 # 共享 React Hooks&#10;│   ├── utils/                 # 通用工具函数&#10;│   └── api-client/            # API 请求封装&#10;├── tooling/&#10;│   ├── tsconfig/&#10;│   └── eslint-config/&#10;├── turbo.json&#10;└── pnpm-workspace.yaml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>frontend-monorepo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── web/                   # Next.js 主站</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── admin/                 # Vite + React 管理后台</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── h5/                    # Vite + React 移动端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── ui/                    # 共享 UI 组件库</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── hooks/                 # 共享 React Hooks</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── utils/                 # 通用工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api-client/            # API 请求封装</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tooling/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── tsconfig/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── eslint-config/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── turbo.json</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── pnpm-workspace.yaml</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;$schema&quot;: &quot;https://turbo.build/schema.json&quot;,&#10;  &quot;tasks&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;build&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;],&#10;      &quot;outputs&quot;: [&quot;dist/**&quot;, &quot;.next/**&quot;]&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;dev&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cache&quot;: false,&#10;      &quot;persistent&quot;: true&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;test&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;dependsOn&quot;: [&quot;^build&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"$schema\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"https://turbo.build/schema.json\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"outputs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"dist/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\".next/**\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"dev\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"cache\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">false</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"persistent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"test\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"dependsOn\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"^build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"关键决策\">关键决策</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>决策点</th>\n<th>选择</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>包管理器</td>\n<td>pnpm</td>\n<td>严格隔离，磁盘高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>任务运行器</td>\n<td>Turborepo</td>\n<td>简洁配置，团队易上手</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>版本策略</td>\n<td>不发布（private）</td>\n<td>纯内部使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>UI 库构建</td>\n<td>不构建（源码直引）</td>\n<td>只在 Monorepo 内部使用</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>共享配置</td>\n<td>tooling/ 目录</td>\n<td>统一 ESLint + TS 配置</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 纯内部使用的前端 Monorepo 通常不需要版本管理和发布流程，所有包标记为 <code>private: true</code>，依赖使用 <code>workspace:*</code> 直接引用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"案例二-全栈-monorepo\">案例二：全栈 Monorepo</h2><h3 id=\"场景特征\">场景特征</h3><p>一个全栈项目包含 React 前端、Node.js 后端 API 和共享的类型定义。前后端共享数据契约、验证逻辑和工具函数。</p>\n<h3 id=\"架构设计\">架构设计</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"fullstack-monorepo/&#10;├── apps/&#10;│   ├── web/                   # Next.js 前端&#10;│   └── api/                   # Fastify 后端&#10;├── packages/&#10;│   ├── types/                 # 共享类型定义&#10;│   ├── validators/            # 共享验证逻辑 (zod schemas)&#10;│   ├── utils/                 # 共享工具函数&#10;│   └── db/                    # 数据库 Schema 和 ORM&#10;├── tooling/&#10;│   ├── tsconfig/&#10;│   └── eslint-config/&#10;└── docker-compose.yml\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>fullstack-monorepo/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── apps/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── web/                   # Next.js 前端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── api/                   # Fastify 后端</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── packages/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── types/                 # 共享类型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── validators/            # 共享验证逻辑 (zod schemas)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── utils/                 # 共享工具函数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── db/                    # 数据库 Schema 和 ORM</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>├── tooling/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   ├── tsconfig/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>│   └── eslint-config/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>└── docker-compose.yml</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"// packages/validators/src/user.ts&#10;import { z } from &#39;zod&#39;;&#10;&#10;export const createUserSchema = z.object({&#10;  name: z.string().min(2).max(50),&#10;  email: z.string().email(),&#10;  role: z.enum([&#39;admin&#39;, &#39;editor&#39;, &#39;viewer&#39;]),&#10;});&#10;&#10;export type CreateUserInput = z.infer&lt;typeof createUserSchema&gt;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// packages/validators/src/user.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> { z } </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'zod'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> createUserSchema</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  name: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">max</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  email: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">email</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  role: z.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">enum</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">([</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'admin'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'editor'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'viewer'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">export</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#